              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "This simple experiment was conducted to investigate the impact of time of sowing on  wheat.  Wheat (cv. Hartog and Batavia) was sown at Gatton on six dates during 1994.  Various data were collected. However final growth data was compromised by mouse damage.  The dataset is used here to study the impact of sowing time on phenological development.",
