            {
              "$type": "Models.Factorial.Experiment, Models",
              "DisabledSimNames": null,
              "Name": "Lincoln1992",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "This trial has never been formally written up.  It was conducted at Plant and Foods A Block, Lincoln, New Zealand with 'Batten' Wheat grown on a Templeton silt loam (160mm AWC/m).  It was a 2 x 2 x 4 factorial with the following treatments:\r\n\r\n1. Sowing Date (5 May 1992 and 5 Aug 1992)  \r\n2. Irrigation (Nil and 120 mm)  \r\n3. Nitrogen (0, Low, Medium and High)  \r\n\r\nThe N applied to the Low, Medium and High N treatments was 100, 150 and 250 kg/ha, respectively, for the May sowing and 50, 100 and 150, respectively, for the August sowing.\r\n\r\nCould not find informaiton confirming sowing rate so assumed typical values of 300 plants per m/2  for the spring sowing 100 plants per m/2 for May sowing.\r\nEmergence was recorded as the 28th of May for the first planting.  The model was predicting this early so delayed sowing date to get emergence date correct..",
                  "Name": "Memo",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [],
                  "Enabled": true,
                  "ReadOnly": false
                },
                {
                  "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factors, Models",
                  "Name": "Factors",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Factorial.Permutation, Models",
                      "Name": "Permutation",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [
                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factor, Models",
                          "Specification": "",
                          "Name": "Sow",
                          "ResourceName": null,
                          "Children": [
                            {
                              "$type": "Models.Factorial.CompositeFactor, Models",
                              "Specifications": [
                                "[Operations]",
                                "[Fertilise].Script.SDSwitch = 1.0"
                              ],
                              "Paths": null,
                              "Values": null,
                              "Name": "5May",
                              "ResourceName": null,
                              "Children": [
                                {
                                  "$type": "Models.Operations, Models",
                                  "OperationsList": [
                                    {
                                      "$type": "Models.Operation, Models",
                                      "Enabled": true,
                                      "Date": "1992-05-15",
                                      "Action": "[Wheat].Sow(population:100, cultivar:\"BattenWinter\", depth:40, rowSpacing:150);",
                                      "Line": "1992-05-15 [Wheat].Sow(population:100, cultivar:\"BattenWinter\", depth:40, rowSpacing:150);"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "Name": "Operations",
                                  "ResourceName": null,
