                {
                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "This trial was conducted on a Vertosol soil on the Liverpool Plains, central-eastern Australia in 2001.  Hybrid Mercury was sown on 19th of June and biomass, leaf area, phenology, soil water (Neutron Moisture Meter) and water use (Bowen Ratio method) were monitored.  More information can be found in [Young2008].",
